# MyWubi English dictionary; derived from SCOWL 2020.12.07.
# Source: https://wordlist.aspell.net/other/
# Modified: english/american/british words at levels <=60; alphabetic lowercase
# words plus I from english-upper.10; exclude other uppercase entries, possessives,
# contractions, accented forms and separate proper-name lists.
# Code is lowercase, output preserves I. Duplicate pairs use the highest weight.
# Weight = (100 - lowest SCOWL level) * 1000, a coarse priority, NOT corpus frequency.
# Complete upstream Copyright follows; keep it when redistributing this file.
# The collective work is Copyright 2000-2018 by Kevin Atkinson as well
# as any of the copyrights mentioned below:
#
#   Copyright 2000-2018 by Kevin Atkinson
#
